cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it, and the paper it accompanies."
title: unitsim
abstract: >-
  Ground-truth simulation for unit discovery in animal vocal sequences: generators whose lexicon,
  frequency law and song structure are known, a reference implementation of the published
  transitional-probability segmentation and its shuffled, rotated and bigram baselines, discrete
  power-law fitting, and a calibration that turns the statistics such a pipeline reports into a
  posterior over frequency laws with an explicit not-identifiable outcome.
type: software
